      "type": "text",
      "text": "🟠 ADAPTADORES  (infraestructura + presentación)\n• features/*/infrastructure/  → impl HTTP del repo, schemas Zod, mappers de API\n• features/*/presentation/  → componentes + hooks (useQuery/useMutation)\n• shared/infrastructure/  → http-client, query client, env, imágenes, i18n\n• shared/ui/  → design system (primitivos)",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "r623843189",
      "originalText": "🟠 ADAPTADORES  (infraestructura + presentación)\n• features/*/infrastructure/  → impl HTTP del repo, schemas Zod, mappers de API\n• features/*/presentation/  → componentes + hooks (useQuery/useMutation)\n• shared/infrastructure/  → http-client, query client, env, imágenes, i18n\n• shared/ui/  → design system (primitivos)",
      "lineHeight": 1.3,
      "baseline": 14,
      "index": "aG",
      "autoResize": true
    },
